{{- $address := get . "work_mail_address" -}}
{{- if not $address -}}
{{-   $matches := regexFindAll `(?m)^User[ \t]+[^\r\n]+` (include (joinPath .chezmoi.homeDir ".config/work-mail-sync/mbsyncrc")) 1 -}}
{{-   if $matches -}}
{{-     $address = trimAll "\"" (trim (regexReplaceAll `^User[ \t]+` (first $matches) "")) -}}
{{-   end -}}
{{- end -}}
{{- if not (regexMatch `^[a-zA-Z0-9._+%-]+@[a-zA-Z0-9.-]+$` $address) -}}
{{- fail "Set work_mail_address in your local chezmoi data." -}}
{{- end }}
IMAPAccount work
Host imap.gmail.com
Port 993
User {{ $address }}
Pass /tokens/work-gmail.json
TLSType IMAPS
AuthMechs XOAUTH2

IMAPStore work-remote
Account work

MaildirStore work-full-local
Path /mail/
Inbox /mail/inbox
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel work-full
Far :work-remote:
Near :work-full-local:
Patterns "*" "INBOX"
Sync Pull New Flags
Create Near
Expunge None
SyncState *
